# .docs/docs/project/PROJECT.md        - Project overview and status
# .docs/docs/project/ARCHITECTURE.md   - Technical architecture details
# .docs/docs/project/DEVELOPMENT-PLAN.md - Phased development plan
# .docs/docs/project/MONZO-AUTH-FLOW.md - Monzo OAuth flow details
